faq@1.1:3db12f63\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"CURRENT_GUIDANCE\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"response-preference-faq@1.1\", \"title\": \"Response Preference — FAQ (v1.1)\", \"sections\": [\"Factual errors\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"response-preference-faq\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"faq\", \"record_kind\": \"faq\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-05T13:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-05T13:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"response_preference\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"project_wide\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U001\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"## Factual errors\\n\\n### Q: What counts as a significant factual error?\\nAn error that changes the central conclusion or the answer the user would act on. A nonessential background detail with no effect on the recommendation is minor.\\n\\n### Q: The source link is dead. Should I penalize the factual claim?\\nRecord that the citation could not be verified. A failed URL alone does not prove the claim is false. Distinguish access failure from an unsupported attribution or fabricated reference.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:rp-audit-manifest-approval@1.0:67038303\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"PRIOR_DECISION\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"rp-audit-manifest-approval@1.0\", \"title\": \"Approve a JSON format for weekly audit manifests\", \"sections\": [\"TL response\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"rp-audit-manifest-approval\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"decision\", 